ing effort\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/31/deepseek-v4-flash-0731/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-31\",\n    \"topics\": [\"LLM\", \"DeepSeek\", \"model release\", \"performance\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"DataClawEval: A Benchmark for Data Engineering Agents\",\n    \"description\": \"Introduces evaluation framework for agents performing data engineering tasks in real industrial environments\",\n    \"author\": \"Debin Meng, Jiaming Yang, Zefang Zong, et al.\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28033\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-31\",\n    \"topics\": [\"data engineering\", \"agent benchmarks\", \"evaluation\", \"industrial AI\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"MANTA: Multi-Agent Network Topology Adaptation\",\n    \"description\": \"Proposes methods for multi-agent systems to dynamically adapt their network structures for improved performance and self-evolution\",\n    \"author\": \"Mao-xun Huang, Jerry Wang, Yi-Cheng Lai, et al.\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28527\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-31\",\n    \"topics\": [\"multi-agent systems\", \"network topology\", \"self-evolution\", \"distributed AI\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Qwen-UI-Agent Technical Report\",\n    \"description\": \"Toward Next-Generation Real-World Centric Foundation GUI Agents - framework for interacting with real-world applications through visual understanding and action execution\",\n    \"author\": \"Hanzhang Zhou, Panrong Tong, Xu Zhang, et al.\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28236\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-31\",\n    \"topics\": [\"GUI agents\", \"computer vision\", \"agent systems\", \"human-computer interaction\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"SKILL-KD: Contrastive Skill Distillation for LLM Agents\",\n    \"description\": \"Focuses on distilling specialized capabilities from large language models into agent systems using contrastive learning approaches\",\n    \"author\": \"Qiming Shi, Yibo Dou, Jiawen Zhu, et al.\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28048\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-31\",\n    \"topics\": [\"LLM agents\", \"skill distillation\", \"contrastive learning\", \"transfer learning\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Three cybersecurity incidents\",\n    \"description\": \"Anthropic reveals three incidents where Claude compromised real infrastructure during evaluations, including uploading malware to PyPI\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.anthropic.com/news/investigating-incidents-cybersecurity-evaluations\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-30\",\n    \"topics\": [\"AI safety\", \"cybersecurity\", \"Anthropic\", \"Claude\", \"red teaming\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"GPT-5.6 price drops\",\n    \"description\": \"GPT-5.6 Terra reduced 20%, GPT-5.6 Luna reduced 80%; now cheaper than Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/30/luna-price-drop/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-30\",\n    \"topics\": [\"OpenAI\", \"GPT-5.6\", \"pricing\", \"LLM costs\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Frontis-MA1: Training an AI4AI Model towards Recursive Self-Improvement\",\n    \"description\": \"Post-trains a 35B meta-evolution agent for MLE around operators including 'Draft, Improve, Debug, Crossover' with execution-grounded training\",\n    \"author\": \"Hugging Face Papers\",\n    \"source\": \"Paper\",\n    \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/papers/2607.28568\",\n    \"published_date\": \"202