cluding OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, Ollama, Llama.cpp, and Codestral.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">IDE integration</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jan 13</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/jamsocket/forevervm\">ForeverVM</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Secure sandbox environment for executing AI-generated code with persistent state between sessions.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI workflow tool</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jan 18</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/Illuvien/illuvien\">Illuvien</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Drag-and-drop AI agent builder for visually constructing LLM workflows and deploying as APIs with one click.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI workflow tool</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jan 11</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/MatterAIOrg/matter-ai\">Matter AI</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Open-source AI code reviewer agent that analyzes pull requests with PR summaries, code review comments, and security vulnerability detection.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI code reviewer</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jan 10</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/SamYuan1990/OpenAI_CodeAgent-action\">OpenAI CodeAgent-action</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            GitHub Action using OpenAI API for CI/ workflows with AST analysis for unit test generation, docs, and CVE scanning.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI workflow automation</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jan 10</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-badge\">GitHub</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/davidorex/project-handoffs\">project-handoffs</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            MCP server for maintaining persistence across AI coding agent sessions with workflow