        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Coding agents now have direct access to Gmail, Google Drive, Calendar, Docs, Sheets, and Google Chat.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Aug 3</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\">Cursor for iPad Released</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            AI-powered coding expanded to tablet devices with inbox feature and full PR review experience.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 29</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\">Codex CLI v0.146.0</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Session management with /new and /clear commands, thread pinning, Agent Plugins support, WebSocket connections, improved Windows compatibility.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 29</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\">Cursor Start Feature Launch</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            New ₹649 monthly plan for developers in India with local pricing and UPI payment options.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\">Gemini CLI v0.53.0</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            LLM triage orchestrator, container build setup, evaluation coverage reports, workspace trust enforcement, and security fixes.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/features/copilot\">GitHub Copilot Data Training Policy</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Now uses interactions from Copilot subscribers to train AI models unless users opt out.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Policy</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge