                   AI-powered coding expanded to tablet devices with inbox feature and full PR review experience.\n   439→                        </div>\n   440→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   441→                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n   442→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 29</span>\n   443→                        </div>\n   444→                    </div>\n   445→\n   446→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   447→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   448→                            <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\">Codex CLI v0.146.0</a>\n   449→                        </div>\n   450→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   451→                            Session management with /new and /clear commands, thread pinning, Agent Plugins support, WebSocket connections, improved Windows compatibility.\n   452→                        </div>\n   453→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   454→                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n   455→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 29</span>\n   456→                        </div>\n   457→                    </div>\n   458→\n   459→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   460→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   461→                            <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\">Cursor Start Feature Launch</a>\n   462→                        </div>\n   463→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   464→                            New ₹649 monthly plan for developers in India with local pricing and UPI payment options.\n   465→                        </div>\n   466→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   467→                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n   468→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n   469→                        </div>\n   470→                    </div>\n   471→\n   472→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   473→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   474→                            <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\">Gemini CLI v0.53.0</a>\n   475→                        </div>\n   476→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   477→                            LLM triage orchestrator, container build setup, evaluation coverage reports, workspace trust enforcement, and security fixes.\n   478→                        </div>\n   479→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   480→                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n   481→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 28</span>\n   482→                        </div>\n   483→                    </div>\n   484→\n   485→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   486→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   487→                            <a href=\"https://github.com/features/copilot\">GitHub Copilot Data Training Policy</a>\n   488→                        </div>\n   489→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   490→                            Now uses interactions from Copilot subscribers to train AI models unless users opt out.\n   491→                        </div>\n   492→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   493→                            <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Policy</span>\n   494→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 24</span>\n   495→                        </div>\n   496→                    </div>\n   497→\n   498→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   499→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   500→                            <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\">Cursor Router Released</a>\n   501→                        </div>\n   502→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   503→                            Intelligent model router with three optimization modes: Intelligence, Balance, and Cost.\n   504→                        </div>\n   505→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   506→                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n   507→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 22</span>\n   508→                        </div>\n   509→                    </div>\n   510→\n   511→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   512→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   513→                            <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\">Codex CLI v0.145.0</a>\n   514→                        </div>\n   515→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   516→                            Paginated history, /import for migrating settings, Amazon Bedrock support, audio inputs, stabilized multi-agent V2.\n   517→                        </div>\n   518→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   519→                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n   520→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 21</span>\n   521→                        </div>\n   522→                    </div>\n   523→                </div>\n   524→            </section>\n   525→\n   526→            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n   527→            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n   528→                <div class=\"column\">\n   529→                    <h2 class=\"section-header\">Technical Insights (20)</h2>\n   530→\n   531→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   532→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   533→                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/2/open-letters/\">Open letters about AI development</a>\n   534→                        </div>\n   535→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   536→                            Microsoft's open weights letter vs Anthropic's counter-argument; 1,324 AI employees request international governance.\n   537→                        </div>\n   538→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   539→                            <span class=\"author-name\">Simon Willison</span> | <span class=\"source-badge\">Blog</span>\n   540→                        </div>\n   541→                        <div class=\"topics\">\n   542→                            <span class=\"tag\">AI policy</span>\n   543→                            <span class=\"tag\">governance</span>\n   544→                        </div>\n   545→                    </div>\n   546→\n   547→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   548→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   549→                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/1/ten-advances-in-mathematics/\">Ten advances in mathematics</a>\n   550→                        </div>\n   551→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   552→                            OpenAI's Astra model solved ten mathematical problems unsolved for over a decade.\n   553→                        </div>\n   554→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   555→                            <span class=\"author-name\">Simon Willison</span> | <span class=\"source-badge\">Blog</span>\n   556→                        </div>\n   557→                        <div class=\"topics\">\n   558→                            <span class=\"tag\">AI research</span>\n   559→                            <span class=\"tag\">mathematics</span>\n   560→                        </div>\n   561→                    </div>\n   562→\n   563→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   564→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   565→                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/31/stateless-mcp/\">Stateless MCP</a>\n   566→                        </